@@ -442,6 +442,14 @@ own loader, subclass :class:`BaseLoader` and override `get_source`.
 
 Here a list of the builtin loaders Jinja provides:
 
+``FileSystemLoader`` sequences may contain priority entries
+written as ``(path, priority)``. Higher priorities come first;
+ties preserve input order. Ordinary paths have priority zero.
+Negative values and duplicates are supported. Lookup and
+listing use the same ordered paths. Boolean priorities and
+malformed tuple entries raise ``TypeError`` on construction.
+Ordinary paths keep their string and path-like input support.
+
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.FileSystemLoader
 
 .. autoclass:: jinja2.PackageLoader
